SUMMARY:AYPROS Lunch & Learn: Straight From the Source: NCDOR Declassified
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Young Professionals (AYPROS)\n**AYPROS Lunch & Learn
 : Straight From the Source: NCDOR Declassified - FREE COWORKING DAY INCLUD
 ED!**\n\n**When:** Wednesday\\\, July 22nd\\\, 2026 \\| 11:30 AM \\- 1:00 
 PM\n**Where:** Hatchworks Coworking\, 45 S French Broad Ave\, Asheville\, 
 NC\n**Presented by:** Edward Shumaker\, Revenue Administration Officer\, N
 orth Carolina Department of Revenue\n\n**Event Overview:**\nTaxes are not 
 exactly anyone’s favorite lunch topic. But if you run a business\, freel
 ance\, manage side income\, work with contractors\, hire employees\, or ju
 st want to understand how things work in North Carolina\, knowing the basi
 cs can save you a lot of confusion later.\n\nThat’s why we’re going st
 raight to the source.\nJoin AYPROS for **“Straight From the Source: NCDO
 R Declassified\,”** an easygoing Lunch & Learn with the North Carolina D
 epartment of Revenue focused on general business tax essentials. This sess
 ion is designed to make some of the common rules\, forms\, deadlines\, and
  resources feel a little more approachable.\n\nWe’ll talk through the ba
 sics of:\n\n*Reporting business income or loss*\n*Common business structur
 es and related filings*\n*Sales and use tax*\n*Withholding tax*\n*Business
  registration with NCDOR*\n*Filing frequencies and due dates*\n*Estimated 
 payments*\n*Recordkeeping expectations*\n*Common penalties and interest*\n
 *Where to find reliable NCDOR resources when questions come up*\n\nThis is
  a great session for young professionals\, entrepreneurs\, freelancers\, n
 onprofit leaders\, managers\, and anyone who wants to feel more informed a
 bout the tax side of doing business in North Carolina.\n\nNo tax backgroun
 d required. Just come ready to learn\, ask questions\, and leave with a cl
 earer sense of what matters\, what to watch for\, and where to go when you
  need answers.\n\nYour RSVP also includes a free coworking day at Hatchwor
 ks Coworking. Come early\, stay late\, and experience Asheville’s favori
 te downtown workspace.\n\n**Wednesday\\\, July 22 \\| 11:30 AM**\n**Hatchw
 orks Coworking \\| 45 S\\. French Broad Ave**\n**Free with RSVP. Space is 
 limited.**\n\nThis Lunch & Learn is presented by the North Carolina Depart
 ment of Revenue\n\nThis session is for general educational purposes and is
  not a substitute for personalized legal\, tax\, or professional advice.
